<title>USA: Franklin Telecom wins GTE contract.</title>
<headline>Franklin Telecom wins GTE contract.</headline>
<dateline>WESTLAKE VILLAGE, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Telecom said Friday its Franklin Internet (FNet) unit, had won a contract to provide high-speed Internet service to GTE Information Systems, a unit of GTE Corp.</p>
<p>The initial contract calls for one year of service.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;While we have many business accounts, this contract with GTE is particularly satisfying since it comes from people who know...the high-tech world and can't afford less than the best for their own business needs,&quot; said Frank Peters, chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
